    "id": "news-1789822021100-6",
    "title": "Galmudug Presidential Candidate Liibaan Axmed Xasan Visits Guriceel",
    "original_title": "Wafdi uu hoggaaminayo murashaxa madaxweynaha Galmudug Liibaan Axmed Xasan oo Gaaray Guriceel",
    "slug": "galmudug-presidential-candidate-liibaan-axmed-xasan-visits-guriceel",
    "summary": "A delegation led by Galmudug presidential candidate Liibaan Axmed Xasan arrived in Guriceel, Galgaduud region, to engage with local authorities and community on political and electoral matters.",
    "content": "A delegation headed by Galmudug presidential candidate Liibaan Axmed Xasan arrived in Guriceel town in the Galgaduud region on Saturday, according to local reports. The group includes senior officials from the Federal Government of Somalia and received a warm welcome from residents.\n\nWhile in Guriceel, the delegation is expected to hold meetings with the local administration and community representatives. The discussions will focus on the political situation and upcoming elections in the Galmudug regional administration.\n\nCandidate Liibaan Axmed Xasan stated that with the Galmudug elections rescheduled, it is necessary for the local community to be fully informed and involved in the process. He emphasized the importance of broad participation in the electoral preparations.\n\nThe visit comes amid ongoing political developments in Galmudug, where regional elections have been postponed. The presence of federal officials in the delegation underscores the significance of the region's stability and governance for the broader Somali political landscape.\n\nFor the Somali diaspora, this event matters as it signals continued engagement with regional political processes that affect representation and development. Many diaspora members maintain ties to Galmudug and have a stake in its peaceful and democratic transition. The meetings in Guriceel could shape the electoral environment and set a precedent for inclusive dialogue, which is crucial for sustaining stability in the region.\n\nThe delegation's visit is part of a series of engagements aimed at fostering consensus and ensuring that local voices are heard in the lead-up to the rescheduled elections. Further details on the outcomes of the meetings are awaited.\n\nRead the original report from Goobjoog here: https://goobjoog.com/2026/09/19/wafdi-uu-hoggaaminayo-murashaxa-madaxweynaha-galmudug-liibaan-axmed-xasan-oo-gaaray-guriceel/",
